{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00807","headline":"郊庙歌辞 後唐宗庙乐舞辞 昭德舞 · 崔居俭、卢文纪","name":"郊庙歌辞 後唐宗庙乐舞辞 昭德舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"懿彼明德，赫赫煌煌。\n名高阃域，功着旗常。\n道符休泰，运叶祺祥。\n庆传万祀，以播耿光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔居俭、卢文纪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00807.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00807","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}